        array("id" => "s1997e15", "season" => 1997, "number" => 15, "name" => "Holmes Freak Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "5 May 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When Conan, Kogoro and Ran attend a gathering for Sherlock Holmes aficionados, the host, who had promised a grand prize for a quiz, is murdered in strange circumstances.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552266.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e16", "season" => 1997, "number" => 16, "name" => "Holmes Freak Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "12 May 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The murderer is still on the loose and his methods have even the most diehard Sherlock Holmes fans completely baffled. The mystery thickens as Conan tries to crack the case!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552267.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e17", "season" => 1997, "number" => 17, "name" => "The First Errand Murder Case", "airdate" => "19 May 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Junior Detective League is back on the case when a young boy becomes the unknowing target of a killer! Conan and his friends must use every trick in their book to protect the tiny tot.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552268.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e18", "season" => 1997, "number" => 18, "name" => "An Illustrator Murder Case", "airdate" => "26 May 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A popular illustrator finds his life falling apart after an affair with a young colleague. Rather than facing his mistakes, he tries to cover them up in brutal fashion. Can Conan see through his ingenious plot?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552269.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e19", "season" => 1997, "number" => 19, "name" => "A Ghost Ship Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "2 Jun 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When a boat believed to have been lost in a storm along with a fortune in gold drifts into harbor after several years, its cargo missing, the locals hire Kogoro to locate the treasure.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552270.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e20", "season" => 1997, "number" => 20, "name" => "A Ghost Ship Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "9 Jun 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro is framed for murder! Now Conan has to clear his name. Things take a difficult twist for Conan when the two prime suspects are both killed. There is only one place left for clues -- into the darkness of the Pirates' Cave!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552271.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e21", "season" => 1997, "number" => 21, "name" => "Big Monster Gomera Murder Case", "airdate" => "16 Jun 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Lights, Camera, Murder! While behind the scenes for the next Gomera monster movie, the Detective Boys stumble onto a murder! Prime suspect: Gomera! It's up to the Detective Boys to see if their favorite monster is innocent or not.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552272.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e22", "season" => 1997, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Third Fingerprint Murder Case", "airdate" => "23 Jun 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When a veteran of the police force kills a mob informant during what appears to be a struggle, Conan suspects that he's lying about it being an act of self-defense.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552273.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e23", "season" => 1997, "number" => 23, "name" => "A Crab and Whale Kidnapping Case", "airdate" => "30 Jun 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A young boy is kidnapped and it's up to Kogoro, Conan, and Ran to help! Time is off the essence when the kidnapper sends a deadly ultimatum: \"No police, no mercy, no time!\"", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552274.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e24", "season" => 1997, "number" => 24, "name" => "Night Road Murder Case", "airdate" => "7 Jul 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan, Ran, and Kogoro are out to eat when they meet students from Beika University. A murder occurs on the street, but somehow the blood ended up on the wall of a building, the railing of a rooftop, and broken glass of an upper apartment window! Conan is aft…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552275.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e25", "season" => 1997, "number" => 25, "name" => "Stage Actress Murder Case", "airdate" => "14 Jul 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "While Kogoro is hired to find out who sent a threatening letter to a stage actress, his old mentor pays him a visit and becomes involved when the actress is poisoned during a rehearsal.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552276.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e26", "season" => 1997, "number" => 26, "name" => "Night Baron Murder Case (Case Part)", "airdate" => "21 Jul 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "While on vacation, Conan gets involved in a Mystery Tour via Professor Agasa. Someone asks if Kogoro is the Night Baron, a character from Shinichi's father's novels. What is supposed to be an innocent Mystery Tour turns quickly as Conan is pushed off a balcon…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552278.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e27", "season" => 1997, "number" => 27, "name" => "Night Baron Murder Case (Suspicion Part)", "airdate" => "28 Jul 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The impaled man in a mask turns out to be Tokio Ebara, a computer hacker. There are several suspects related to Tokio, with a lack of solid alibis. The Night Baron appears once again and Ran engages him in karate, but he manages to foil her kick! Conan finds…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552280.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e28", "season" => 1997, "number" => 28, "name" => "Night Baron Murder Case (Resolution Part)", "airdate" => "4 Aug 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Ran suspects the culprit is Satoru Maeda, the only person at the hotel capable of blocking her kick. While Conan begins to suspect this as well, his alibi is solid. Once Conan learns that the wind that blows in this time of the year is a famous one named \"Him…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552281.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e29", "season" => 1997, "number" => 29, "name" => "A Stalker's Murder Case", "airdate" => "11 Aug 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Ran, Conan, and Kogoro takes a nice morning walk around the neighborhood. Kogoro buys an energy drink called Kasuman, then a person screams out loud and they rush over just to see a man die and a bottle of Kasuman next to him. Was it poison?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552282.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e30", "season" => 1997, "number" => 30, "name" => "The Triplet's Country Home Murder Case", "airdate" => "18 Aug 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan and Ran find themselves embroiled in a murder at a private beach. However, even more disturbing than the brutal death is the list of prime suspects: the victim's triplet sons!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552283.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e31", "season" => 1997, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Detective Boys' Disaster Case", "airdate" => "25 Aug 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "An S.O.S. message in a bottle disrupts Conan's beachside vacation. Can he and his Junior Detective League friends find the young woman they believe to be the note's author?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552284.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e32", "season" => 1997, "number" => 32, "name" => "The Death God Jinnai Murder Case", "airdate" => "1 Sep 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When a killer claiming to be the King of Death sends a threat to movie star, Conan, Kogoro, and Ran must stop the culprit from making good on his warning: At the stroke of midnight, you will die!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552285.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e33", "season" => 1997, "number" => 33, "name" => "Loan Company President's Murder Case", "airdate" => "8 Sep 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mahjong: a game of strategy, skill, and luck - three things that a sinister murderer hopes he has on his side! Conan must stack the clues and place details in order if he is to win this terrifying game!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552286.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e34", "season" => 1997, "number" => 34, "name" => "Conan vs. Kaitou Kid", "airdate" => "22 Sep 1997", "runtime" => 60, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan enters a battle of wits with an elusive master thief known as Kaito Kid and has to stop him from stealing a precious pearl from Sonoko's family aboard a cruise ship.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552287.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e35", "season" => 1997, "number" => 35, "name" => "Distinguished Family's Consecutive Accidental Death Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "20 Oct 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When Kogoro is hired to find wealthy man's childhood sweetheart, a murder takes place right under his nose - and the prime suspect turns up dead.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014793.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e36", "season" => 1997, "number" => 36, "name" => "Distinguished Family's Consecutive Accidental Death Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "27 Oct 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan and Heiji Hattori's covert investigation continues. But with precious few suspects, one big question haunts the brilliant duo: If the wealthy man didn't commit the murder, then who did?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014799.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e37", "season" => 1997, "number" => 37, "name" => "The Bank Heist Murder Case", "airdate" => "3 Nov 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan and Ran become embroiled in a bank robbery that ends in murder. Just when Inspector Megure thinks he's solved the crime, Conan discovers a hidden agenda that busts the case wide-open!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014803.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e38", "season" => 1997, "number" => 38, "name" => "The Wandering Artist Murder Case", "airdate" => "10 Nov 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When the Junior Detective League sets out to help an ailing homeless man, they end up involved in a new murder mystery. They know who did it - but can they get anyone to listen to them?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552291.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e39", "season" => 1997, "number" => 39, "name" => "The Kidnapping of a Popular Artist Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "17 Nov 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Ran and Sonoko are off to see a concert sang by TWO-MIX. Meanwhile, Conan and the Detective Boys accidentally bumps into one of the singers for TWO-MIX, Minami. Minami takes the Detective Boys out to eat lunch then she gets up to take a phone call and gets ki…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552292.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e40", "season" => 1997, "number" => 40, "name" => "The Kidnapping of a Popular Artist Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "24 Nov 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The singers of TWO-MIX were kidnapped by two men. Conan and the Detective Boys were with one of the members and tells Inspector Megure what happened. The kidnappers want a tape that TWO-MIX sang because it had hints that led them to a crime they had done a wh…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552293.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e41", "season" => 1997, "number" => 41, "name" => "General Hospital Murder Case", "airdate" => "1 Dec 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro witnesses a murder in the hospital, but his eyes may be playing tricks on him: he sees the same scene four nights in a row. Things get even stranger when he emerges as the prime suspect.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014807.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e42", "season" => 1997, "number" => 42, "name" => "Ski Lodge Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "8 Dec 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan, Ran and Sonoko get stranded at a ski lodge with an old teacher while someone is hiding in the dark and strangling the residents in the night.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552295.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1997e43", "season" => 1997, "number" => 43, "name" => "Ski Lodge Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "15 Dec 1997", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After Sonoko was attacked, the words MASSACRE NIGHT were found written on her hand. Conan leaps into action to uncover the truth, but sometimes the truth is too much to handle.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014810.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 1998, "name" => "#86 - #128", "rating" => null, "episodes" => array(
        array("id" => "s1998e1", "season" => 1998, "number" => 1, "name" => "The Kidnapping Location Case", "airdate" => "12 Jan 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The Junior Detective League is after a kidnapper who has dubious intentions. There's more than one life at stake if Conan can't figure out where the captive child is hidden.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552297.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e2", "season" => 1998, "number" => 2, "name" => "The Crane's Return of a Favor Murder Case", "airdate" => "19 Jan 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan and Ran take Kogoro on a crane-watching trip, but the man responsible for the birds' well being is found murdered. The victim's son turns himself in, but Conan suspects the guy is innocent.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014814.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e3", "season" => 1998, "number" => 3, "name" => "Dracula's Villa Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "26 Jan 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro is hired by a horror novelist to find out with whom his wife is having an affair. Later the same evening, the man is killed in a ritualistic manner and all of the house guests turn out to have motives.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014818.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e4", "season" => 1998, "number" => 4, "name" => "Dracula's Villa Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "2 Feb 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Horror novelist Stefan Van Croven has been pierced through the chest with a wooden stake. Kogoro is convinced that the answer is right under his nose, but he doesn't know that Conan's figured out the trick.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014820.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e5", "season" => 1998, "number" => 5, "name" => "The Flower Scent Murder Case", "airdate" => "9 Feb 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro is asked to investigate a murder threat against Rika Okano, a respected artist who is up for an award. The threat is simple: If Rika receives the award, she will be murdered.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/405/1014824.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e6", "season" => 1998, "number" => 6, "name" => "The Bank Robber's Hospitalization Case", "airdate" => "16 Feb 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "After Kogoro breaks his leg, Conan stops by to visit and senses all is not right with Mori's hospital roommates. His suspicions are justified when a high stakes game of kidnapping and murder begins.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552302.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e7", "season" => 1998, "number" => 7, "name" => "The Fearful Traversing Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "23 Feb 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro, Ran and Conan join a client who has hired an assassin known as \"the Fox\" to kill him to a hike in the mountain to stop the assassin, who turns out to be a member of the party when a guide is killed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1015025.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e8", "season" => 1998, "number" => 8, "name" => "The Fearful Traversing Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "2 Mar 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan is faced with the task of tracking the Fox, the world's most notorious assassin, after the mysterious death of two campers. Can Conan stop him from killing again?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1015032.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e9", "season" => 1998, "number" => 9, "name" => "Snow Woman's Legend Murder Case", "airdate" => "9 Mar 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A wonderland of wintertime fun becomes a stage for tragedy following the death of an actress at the peak of her career. But a suicide note and a history of poor health don't always add up to the obvious.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1015040.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e10", "season" => 1998, "number" => 10, "name" => "Kogoro's Date Murder Case", "airdate" => "16 Mar 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro's set to reunite with a childhood friend, but what happens is more than Kogoro ever could have imagined. What do an old ink pen, a security camera, and three children add up to? Murder.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1015045.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e11", "season" => 1998, "number" => 11, "name" => "The Cornered Famous Detective! Two Big Murder Cases", "airdate" => "23 Mar 1998", "runtime" => 120, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Ran becomes suspicious of Conan when she notices that he looks a lot like Shinichi when he was his age. Meanwhile, Conan becomes involved in the investigations of the murders of a magician and a friend of his mother's.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1015053.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e12", "season" => 1998, "number" => 12, "name" => "The Farewell Wine Murder Case", "airdate" => "13 Apr 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro is hired by a retiring billionaire to stop his daughters from killing him for the inheritance. When he is poisoned, Conan realizes that there is more to his death than meets the eye.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1015055.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e13", "season" => 1998, "number" => 13, "name" => "The Famous Potter Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "20 Apr 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "While visiting a famous potter, Conan, Kogoro, and Ran stumble upon what they believe to be a suicide - but was it? As the detectives soon learn, looks can often times be deceiving.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1015058.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e14", "season" => 1998, "number" => 14, "name" => "The Famous Potter Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "27 Apr 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan tries to unravel the mystery of an apparent suicide, but how can he prove a murder took place when all of the suspects - including Kogoro, Ran, and himself - share the same alibi?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552331.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e15", "season" => 1998, "number" => 15, "name" => "The Memories of First Love Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "11 May 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Ran and Conan join Asami, one of Shinichi's old flames, on a weekend getaway. When the villa catches fire, Ran risks her life to save her competition. Was the fire an accident? Or is something sinister afoot?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1016581.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e16", "season" => 1998, "number" => 16, "name" => "The Memories of First Love Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "18 May 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan quickly figures out the complicated method the arsonist used to torch the house, as well as the motive behind it. But after the case is solved, Shinichi is in for an embarrassing surprise of his own.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1016583.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e17", "season" => 1998, "number" => 17, "name" => "The Historical Actor Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "25 May 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A movie star hires Kogoro to advise him for a role as a detective. But the line between fact and fiction blurs when Kogoro, Ran, and Conan discover they have front row seats to an act of murder.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1016587.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e18", "season" => 1998, "number" => 18, "name" => "The Historical Actor Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "1 Jun 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "As the media flocks to the high-profile murder case, the police prepare to charge a movie star with murder. Can Conan prove he knows who actually committed the crime?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1016592.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e19", "season" => 1998, "number" => 19, "name" => "The Mysterious Mansion of a Band of Thieves Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "8 Jun 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When Conan and Ran join Kogoro for a trip to Nakamura Manor, they learn of a troubling secret that may link Misao Nakamura, the original lord of the estate, to a band of thieves known as The Goblins.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1016782.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e20", "season" => 1998, "number" => 20, "name" => "The Mysterious Mansion of a Band of Thieves Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "15 Jun 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan, Kogoro, and Ran attempt to decipher a secret code that promises to solve the strange mysteries of Nakamura Manor. The unsuspecting sleuths have no clue that the goblins they hunt are very real.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/406/1016787.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e21", "season" => 1998, "number" => 21, "name" => "Scoop Picture Murder Case", "airdate" => "22 Jun 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When a photographer wins an award for capturing a fire on film, it seems like his career has been made - but when Kogoro accuses him of being a murderer on TV, one of their careers is about to go up in smoke.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/407/1017847.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e22", "season" => 1998, "number" => 22, "name" => "The Mysterious Mole Alien Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "29 Jun 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A distraught man visits Kogoro about his murdered sister, but things just don't add up. A jewelry store heist and a car chase lead Conan back to the scene of the crime as another case unfolds.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/407/1018227.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e23", "season" => 1998, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Mysterious Mole Alien Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "6 Jul 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A suspected murder, a jewel heist, and a missing body have Conan and the Junior Detective League working every angle to crack the case. Will Conan be able to put the clues together in time?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/407/1018237.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e24", "season" => 1998, "number" => 24, "name" => "Detective Club Pursuit Case", "airdate" => "13 Jul 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When a killer spies the Junior Detective League on TV, he decides to use them for his own evil purposes. Can Conan and his pals see through his plan or will they unwittingly help him get away with murder?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/408/1020288.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e25", "season" => 1998, "number" => 25, "name" => "Cooking Classroom Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "27 Jul 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When Kogoro and Ran attend a cooking class and the teacher is stabbed in the back with a very thin weapon during a blackout, Conan realizes that the killer is one of her students and the weapon is hidden somewhere in the classroom.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/409/1024029.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e26", "season" => 1998, "number" => 26, "name" => "Cooking Classroom Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "3 Aug 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "All four suspects had a reason to stab their cooking instructor in the back. But what was the murder weapon, where is it hidden, and how was the killer able to strike in a pitch-black kitchen?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/409/1024033.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e27", "season" => 1998, "number" => 27, "name" => "The Seven Mysteries of Teitan Elementary School Case", "airdate" => "10 Aug 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Intruders and disappearances lead to rumors that Teitan Elementary School is haunted. The Junior Detective League springs into action, and Conan senses that a few teachers are covering something up.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/410/1026842.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e28", "season" => 1998, "number" => 28, "name" => "The White Sandy Beach Murder Case", "airdate" => "17 Aug 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Ran and Conan discover a woman's body, and the victim's best friend accuses the Medical Examiner of murder. The Doctor is definitely a heel, but is he really guilty of murder?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/414/1037324.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e29", "season" => 1998, "number" => 29, "name" => "Scuba Diving Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "24 Aug 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan and the gang befriend a group of university students at an ocean resort. When a banded sea snake attacks, a life hangs in the balance! Can Conan uncover the truth behind an attempted murder?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/415/1038513.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e30", "season" => 1998, "number" => 30, "name" => "Scuba Diving Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "31 Aug 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A young woman is barely clinging to life and every individual in the group of college students is a suspect. Can Conan make sense of it in time? Or will a murderer escape without a trace?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/415/1038523.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e31", "season" => 1998, "number" => 31, "name" => "The Mystery Writer Disappearance Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "7 Sep 1998", "runtime" => 25, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When a vanished mystery writer begins a new story series, his daughter seeks help from Kogoro to track him down. Conan realizes that time is running out when he finds hidden messages in his new texts.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/416/1040474.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e32", "season" => 1998, "number" => 32, "name" => "The Mystery Writer Disappearance Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "14 Sep 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The codes hidden within the novel are more complex than Conan originally thought. But how can he lead the investigators toward answers without his voice-emulating tie?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/416/1040507.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e33", "season" => 1998, "number" => 33, "name" => "The Naniwa Serial Murder Case", "airdate" => "21 Sep 1998", "runtime" => 60, "rating" => null, "summary" => "While visiting Heiji's hometown on the west coast, Conan joins him in investigating a mysterious serial killer case.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/418/1045121.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e34", "season" => 1998, "number" => 34, "name" => "The Kamen Yaiba Murder Case", "airdate" => "12 Oct 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Reality and fantasy collide! After the Junior Detective League meets a member of the Laser Police - and Kamen Yaiba - a murder takes place right before their eyes!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/421/1053227.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e35", "season" => 1998, "number" => 35, "name" => "A Honey Cocktail Murder Case", "airdate" => "19 Oct 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro is invited to a mountain retreat by a former client, but his hopes of romance end when she jumps off of a balcony to her death. Did she commit suicide or was it murder?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/428/1070646.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e36", "season" => 1998, "number" => 36, "name" => "The Locked Bathroom Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "26 Oct 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Mori Kogoro loses his Yoko concert ticket and finds Masayo instead. The detective discovers the two share some common interests: music, Yoko Okino, and murder!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/428/1072273.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e37", "season" => 1998, "number" => 37, "name" => "The Locked Bathroom Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "2 Nov 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A blood stain leads Conan to revisit one of the most disturbing murder mysteries of his career. Unless he can get through to inspector Megure, a killer could walk free!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/428/1072277.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e38", "season" => 1998, "number" => 38, "name" => "The Weather Girl Kidnapping Case", "airdate" => "9 Nov 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A popular anchorwoman disappears and the Junior Detective League is called into action! Coded messages, symbols, and wild weather send the gang on a frenzied game of cat and mouse!", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/428/1072490.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e39", "season" => 1998, "number" => 39, "name" => "A Mysterious Sniper Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "16 Nov 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Seiji Ishimoto, president of an electronic company, claims he has been receiving threat letters and hires Kogoro as a bodyguard.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/432/1081892.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e40", "season" => 1998, "number" => 40, "name" => "A Mysterious Sniper Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "23 Nov 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Investigation into the minister's assassination continues.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/220/552389.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e41", "season" => 1998, "number" => 41, "name" => "The Traveling Drama Troupe Murder Case (Part One)", "airdate" => "30 Nov 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The scriptwriter for the Drama Traveling Troupe's is found dead. Aside from the murder, a disc was also stolen. What was on the disc?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/442/1106393.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e42", "season" => 1998, "number" => 42, "name" => "The Traveling Drama Troupe Murder Case (Part Two)", "airdate" => "7 Dec 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "The disc is found in the director's room, but it is empty. The Director was knocked out on stage and the treasurer was pushed to her death. Conan realizes only two people had time to kill the scriptwriter.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/442/1106398.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s1998e43", "season" => 1998, "number" => 43, "name" => "The Black Organization: One Billion Yen Robbery Case", "airdate" => "14 Dec 1998", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan meets Akemi Miyano, who has stolen money to free her the Black Organization. However, they betray her and Conan learns more about the existence of the Black Organization with her dying breath.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/450/1126768.jpg"),
