        array("id" => "s2000e40", "season" => 2000, "number" => 40, "name" => "Mushrooms, Bears, and the Detective Boys (Part Two)", "airdate" => "13 Nov 2000", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Bear hunters are in search of a legendary bear. Conan decides to follow the murderer to see why he killed a man, but does not try to harm anyone else.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/222/555560.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2000e41", "season" => 2000, "number" => 41, "name" => "The Mysterious Retro Room Case", "airdate" => "20 Nov 2000", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "A murder occurs in a retro hotel room at Dolphinland. Why is there an ice cream bar, candies, pepper spray and a coin-operated television in the room?", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/552/1382115.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2000e42", "season" => 2000, "number" => 42, "name" => "Bay of the Revenge (Part One)", "airdate" => "27 Nov 2000", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Kogoro has a lawyer client who is receiving death letters from someone with the initials \"T.K.\". When the lawyer ends up dead and a man with the initials \"T.K.\" was a former client of the lawyer, the prime suspect is found. However, when they arrive at his ho…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/222/555562.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2000e43", "season" => 2000, "number" => 43, "name" => "Bay of the Revenge (Part Two)", "airdate" => "4 Dec 2000", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Conan discovers a clue linking the murdered lawyer, Kensuke Tachibana, and his former client \"Tatsuya Kumada\", both with a \"T\" and \"K\" in their initials.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/222/555563.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2000e44", "season" => 2000, "number" => 44, "name" => "Megure's Sealed Secret (Part One)", "airdate" => "11 Dec 2000", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "When Kogoro and Conan are waiting for Ran and Sonoko to finish shopping, Kogoro spots an attractive woman coming out of the phone booth. Conan spots a pen inside the booth, and tells Kogoro. Immediately Kogoro gets the pen and reaches to touch the woman--boom…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/222/555564.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s2000e45", "season" => 2000, "number" => 45, "name" => "Megure's Sealed Secret (Part Two)", "airdate" => "18 Dec 2000", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => null, "summary" => "Inspection follows. It is found that the victim had been involved in a car crash a year ago, in the same parking lot. Using information from the previous three victims, Conan figures that the murderer's motive was probably because of the high-top shoes that \"…", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/222/555565.jpg"),
    )),
    array("number" => 2001, "name" => "#219 - #262", "rating" => null, "episodes" => array(
